      "reasoning": "I need a quick diagnostic to see if the learner links polarity with the correct force type. One focused question will reveal their current thinking without giving away the answer.",
      "content": "What type of intermolecular force would you expect for a molecule that is non‑polar and has no permanent dipole moment?"
    },
